## AI usage
As already stated in the project description, AI tools were used to review and edit parts of the code.

None of the assets used in the app or on the website were created with AI.

All changes made with AI were reviewed and corrected by human contributors.

If you find any inconsistencies, especially in comments, that may have been caused by an AI malfunction, please point them out.

AI will always be used only as a tool for the developer, not as a replacement.
